{"id":"33c947461e9585e1","group":"90","path":"90/90-df-omega-rule.md","title":"Omega Rule","display":"df-omega-rule — Omega Rule","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference","book_abbrev":"90","label":"90-df-omega-rule","aliases":["90-df-omega-rule"],"display":"df-omega-rule — Omega Rule","depends_on":["[[90-df-numeral]]","[[90-df-formula]]","[[90-df-predicate-logic]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"90"},{"key":"label","html":"90-df-omega-rule"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>90-df-omega-rule</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-omega-rule — Omega Rule"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d53b945955293235\" href=\"?note=d53b945955293235\" title=\"90-df-numeral\">90-df-numeral</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4ce2b2789d377e1f\" href=\"?note=4ce2b2789d377e1f\" title=\"90-df-formula\">90-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b7d96c072a4c677f\" href=\"?note=b7d96c072a4c677f\" title=\"90-df-predicate-logic\">90-df-predicate-logic</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-omega-rule-—-Omega-Rule-$\\omega$\">df-omega-rule — Omega Rule <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span></h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\supseteq S_{\\mathrm{arith}}\">\\(S\\supseteq S_{\\mathrm{arith}}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_S\">\\(T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_S\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fml}_S,\\mathrm{Fml}_S^{(1)}\">\\(\\mathrm{Fml}_S,\\mathrm{Fml}_S^{(1)}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"4ce2b2789d377e1f\" href=\"?note=4ce2b2789d377e1f\" title=\"90-df-formula\">90-df-formula</a>，数码见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"d53b945955293235\" href=\"?note=d53b945955293235\" title=\"90-df-numeral\">90-df-numeral</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\mathrm{FOL}},\\mathrm{MP},\\mathrm{Gen},\\mathrm{Rules}_{\\mathrm{FOL}}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\mathrm{FOL}},\\mathrm{MP},\\mathrm{Gen},\\mathrm{Rules}_{\\mathrm{FOL}}\\)</span> 均为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"b7d96c072a4c677f\" href=\"?note=b7d96c072a4c677f\" title=\"90-df-predicate-logic\">90-df-predicate-logic</a> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 上的实例。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi(v)\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S^{(1)}\">\\(\\varphi(v)\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S^{(1)}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S\">\\(\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\)</span>，所有公式代入使用同一语法接口。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{OmegaClosed}_T\">\\(\\mathrm{OmegaClosed}_T\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{OmegaCl}\">\\(\\operatorname{OmegaCl}\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vdash_\\omega\">\\(\\vdash_\\omega\\)</span> 为下式定义的闭包谓词、闭包函数及推导关系。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{OmegaClosed}_T(X)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\n&amp;X\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\land T\\cup\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\mathrm{FOL}}\\subseteq X\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall(\\vec\\sigma,\\tau)\\in\\mathrm{Rules}_{\\mathrm{FOL}}\\\n(\\{\\sigma_i:i&lt;|\\vec\\sigma|\\}\\subseteq X\\Longrightarrow\\tau\\in X)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\varphi(v)\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S^{(1)}\\\n((\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\varphi[\\overline n/v]\\in X)\\Longrightarrow(\\forall v\\varphi)\\in X),\\\\\n&amp;\\mathrm{OmegaClosed}_T(\\mathrm{Fml}_S),\\\\\n\\operatorname{OmegaCl}(T)&amp;\\coloneqq\\bigcap\\{X\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_S:\\mathrm{OmegaClosed}_T(X)\\},\\\\\nT\\vdash_\\omega\\psi&amp;\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\psi\\in\\operatorname{OmegaCl}(T),\\\\\n&amp;\\forall\\varphi(v)\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S^{(1)}\\\n((\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\ T\\vdash_\\omega\\varphi[\\overline n/v])\\Longrightarrow\nT\\vdash_\\omega\\forall v\\varphi).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{OmegaClosed}_T(X)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\n&amp;X\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\land T\\cup\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\mathrm{FOL}}\\subseteq X\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall(\\vec\\sigma,\\tau)\\in\\mathrm{Rules}_{\\mathrm{FOL}}\\\n(\\{\\sigma_i:i&lt;|\\vec\\sigma|\\}\\subseteq X\\Longrightarrow\\tau\\in X)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\varphi(v)\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S^{(1)}\\\n((\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\varphi[\\overline n/v]\\in X)\\Longrightarrow(\\forall v\\varphi)\\in X),\\\\\n&amp;\\mathrm{OmegaClosed}_T(\\mathrm{Fml}_S),\\\\\n\\operatorname{OmegaCl}(T)&amp;\\coloneqq\\bigcap\\{X\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_S:\\mathrm{OmegaClosed}_T(X)\\},\\\\\nT\\vdash_\\omega\\psi&amp;\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\psi\\in\\operatorname{OmegaCl}(T),\\\\\n&amp;\\forall\\varphi(v)\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S^{(1)}\\\n((\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\ T\\vdash_\\omega\\varphi[\\overline n/v])\\Longrightarrow\nT\\vdash_\\omega\\forall v\\varphi).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>该规则有可数无穷多个前提；交定义保证结论属于闭包。原文件中的裸 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vdash\">\\(\\vdash\\)</span> 只有在显式选用这个扩充演算时才能表示 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vdash_\\omega\">\\(\\vdash_\\omega\\)</span>，不能把规则当成普通有限一阶演算的既有可导规则。其余文件的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\vdash\\sigma\">\\(T\\vdash\\sigma\\)</span> 仍指原有限演算，证明码定义不变。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-omega-rule-—-Omega-Rule-$\\omega$","text":"df-omega-rule — Omega Rule $\\omega$","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"90-df-numeral","status":"resolved","id":"d53b945955293235","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-numeral]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"4ce2b2789d377e1f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-predicate-logic","status":"resolved","id":"b7d96c072a4c677f","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-predicate-logic]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"4ce2b2789d377e1f","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$S\\supseteq S_{\\mathrm{arith}}$、$T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_S$；$\\mathrm{Fml}_S,\\mathrm{Fml}_S^{(1)}$ 见 [[90-df-formula]]，数码见 [[90-df-numeral]]。","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-numeral","status":"resolved","id":"d53b945955293235","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$S\\supseteq S_{\\mathrm{arith}}$、$T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_S$；$\\mathrm{Fml}_S,\\mathrm{Fml}_S^{(1)}$ 见 [[90-df-formula]]，数码见 [[90-df-numeral]]。","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-predicate-logic","status":"resolved","id":"b7d96c072a4c677f","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\mathrm{FOL}},\\mathrm{MP},\\mathrm{Gen},\\mathrm{Rules}_{\\mathrm{FOL}}$ 均为 [[90-df-predicate-logic]] 在 $S$ 上的实例。$\\varphi(v)\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S^{(1)}$，$\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S$，所有公式代入使用同一语法接口。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"S\\supseteq S_{\\mathrm{arith}}","display":false},{"tex":"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Fml}_S,\\mathrm{Fml}_S^{(1)}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\mathrm{FOL}},\\mathrm{MP},\\mathrm{Gen},\\mathrm{Rules}_{\\mathrm{FOL}}"